Subject: [PATCH] Restore forceUpgrade


diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/Main.java b/net/minecraft/server/Main.java
index e2939cc39a8c103e4c4d7b01d39b5546486e4fbc..fc05c91136b98eeca43dca0f3228cad184c6d9a1 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/Main.java
